  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Refugee and host community response in Eastern Sudan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;The overall objective of DRCs proposed response is that refugee and host communities in Eastern Sudan co-exist in a peaceful environment and are better supported to access assistance and services, and benefit from an improved protective environment.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
